[00:10:07.848,000] <inf> net_mdns_responder: matched query: zephyr._zephyr._tcp.local port: 5683
[00:10:08.052,000] <inf> net_mdns_responder: Received 2 queries from xx.xx.20.16
[00:10:08.052,000] <inf> net_mdns_responder: [2] query PTR/IN label ._zephyr._tcp.local (19 bytes)
[00:10:08.052,000] <err> net_dns_sd: qsize 5 > size[2] - 1 4
[00:10:08.052,000] <err> net_mdns_responder: unable to extract query (-105)
```

Didn't you get these printouts?
